+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+The ``config`` command will print the application's configuration values
+as JSON. Values for keys containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``,
+or ``KEY`` are masked for security.
+
+.. versionadded:: 3.2
+
